           END-EXEC.

      *    PERFORM DISPLAY-TEST-RESULT.
           PERFORM UNTIL SQLCODE NOT = ZERO
              DISPLAY EMP-NAME-ARR
              DISPLAY EMP-NAME-LEN
              EXEC SQL
                  FETCH C1 INTO :EMP-NAME
              END-EXEC
      *        PERFORM DISPLAY-TEST-RESULT
